  qrCodeID: "Toprak D\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC G\xF6stergesi"
  title: "Toprak D\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC G\xF6stergesi"
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2a19aaadcf7844142a73ce60950ec353, type: 3}
  message: "Toprak D\xF6ng\xFCs\xFC G\xF6stergesi, test sistemi ile topraklama ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n
    do\u011Fru ve kesintisiz oldu\u011Funu g\xF6steren g\xFCvenlik g\xF6stergesidir.
    Sistem, topraklama d\xF6ng\xFCs\xFCn\xFC s\xFCrekli kontrol ederek g\xFCvenli
    \xE7al\u0131\u015Fma ko\u015Fullar\u0131n\u0131n sa\u011Fland\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    do\u011Frular. Topraklama ba\u011Flant\u0131s\u0131nda bir hata veya s\xFCreksizlik
    tespit edilmesi durumunda test ekipman\u0131n\u0131n enerjilendirilmesine izin
    verilmez. Bu g\xF6sterge, y\xFCksek gerilim testlerine ba\u015Flamadan \xF6nce
    kontrol edilmesi gereken temel g\xFCvenlik g\xF6stergelerinden biridir."
